                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "48afd00f-6345-3a1c-a2e0-6034164f0ec3",
                                        "entry_id": "54547e11-096b-3f5b-b15e-a135b86a225c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a condescending manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "930811a0-5b68-4868-8773-8b66a4357e9e",
                                                "sense_id": "48afd00f-6345-3a1c-a2e0-6034164f0ec3",
                                                "text": "[…]; and as there was some perilous probability, in the event of the Colonel and Coloneless saying ‘no,’ of the Captain’s proposing to Miss De Fudgeville, orphan daughter and heiress of the late Rear-Admiral De Fudgeville, who, though she was as ugly as sin, and had something the matter with her spine, had a fortune of ninety thousand pounds, the gallant Colonel, late of the Heavies, and his wife, condescendingly agreed to accept Algernon as their son-in-law."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3128d61-9ffd-4e3c-9c8d-a4af21143b10",
                                                "sense_id": "48afd00f-6345-3a1c-a2e0-6034164f0ec3",
                                                "text": "He wore his strange and colourful clothes as if for inspection by a lesser being: condescendingly, casually."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7542da9-000c-4733-803b-2d406c77e23f",
                                                "sense_id": "48afd00f-6345-3a1c-a2e0-6034164f0ec3",
                                                "text": "\"What seems to be the trouble my child? Ah, the pains of youth,\" he nodded condescendingly."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5d4a1060-4ddb-48d5-bd80-dfe8d0aaf9df",
                        "source_entry_id": "1b4afbf2-9ed6-3b79-85ee-ab05f0143e6e",
                        "source_sense_description": "покровительственно-высокомерно",
                        "target_lang_word": "condescendiente",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "condescendiente",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "809c4f7f-845c-3aa8-baa0-859a1e1f5452",
                                        "entry_id": "f66f0269-6538-3d0f-94c8-fa1a7212c508",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Que condesciende."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57cc7755-3cfe-471f-be34-0fb165fd1eda",
                                                "sense_id": "809c4f7f-845c-3aa8-baa0-859a1e1f5452",
                                                "text": "Mi genio naturalmente blando y condescendiente me inclinaría a esta parte; y bien mirada puede ser más perjudicial en la Iglesia que la nimia severidad."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "31bc5bf4-3bc7-3fb4-abfe-a89313a1267c",
                                        "entry_id": "f66f0269-6538-3d0f-94c8-fa1a7212c508",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pronto o dispuesto a condescender."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c9a0553e-7013-4600-bcd6-085aec30589c",
                                                "sense_id": "31bc5bf4-3bc7-3fb4-abfe-a89313a1267c",
                                                "text": "¿Es posible que has de ser tan inexorable conmigo, al mismo tiempo que callas y te muestras tan condescendiente con otros?"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7bd7a780-0747-3792-ba24-177598243871",
                                        "entry_id": "f66f0269-6538-3d0f-94c8-fa1a7212c508",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dicho de una cosa: Propia de alguien condescendiente₁."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d06c62c4-5119-459b-9557-5d67d7b9b2fe",
                                                "sense_id": "7bd7a780-0747-3792-ba24-177598243871",
                                                "text": "Horacio reflejaba la sociedad epicúrea en que vivia; seguia en sus versos la filosofía superficial y condescendiente que cuadraba á su vida alegre y regalada, y cantaba la fortaleza estóica (Justum ac tenacem) al són de los halagos de Mecénas, como Ciceron escribia su paradoja sobre la economía en una mesa que le habia costado doscientos mil sestercios."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c4548d1c-d4a7-411f-ba72-f5b990643762",
                                                "sense_id": "7bd7a780-0747-3792-ba24-177598243871",
                                                "text": "Si se ha inclinado graciosamente para estrechar la mano de la plebe que la invade, y si por un acto de condescendiente cortesía ha descubierto su cabeza, arrancando de ella las coronas de sus antiguas glorias, á la vez, esas mismas coronas permanecen pintadas en las portezuelas de sus berlinas."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
